<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/logo.png">
</head>
<body class="public-page">
    <%- include('partials/site-header', { active: 'faq' }) %>

    <main class="container content-section narrow-page">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="eyebrow">Help & answers</span>
            <h1>Frequently asked questions</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
            <details class="faq-item" open>
                <summary>How quickly can care begin?</summary>
                <p>In many cases, we can begin care within 24 to 48 hours after the initial assessment.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>Do you offer 24-hour support?</summary>
                <p>Yes. We provide flexible support from short visits to 24/7 live-in care arrangements.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>Are carers Garda vetted?</summary>
                <p>Yes. Every team member undergoes checks and mandatory training before assignment.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>Can I change my care schedule?</summary>
                <p>Yes. Care plans are reviewed regularly and can be adjusted as needs change.</p>
            </details>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/site-footer') %>
</body>
</html>
